<title>FINLAND: Kemira 8-month sales, profit by division.</title>
<headline>Kemira 8-month sales, profit by division.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish chemicals group Kemira Oy on Thursday gave the following breakdown of its January-August results (million markka):</p>
<p>    Net sales:	   Jan-Aug 96     Jan-Aug 95	Jan-Dec 95</p>
<p> Kemira Chemicals	  1,802	    1,657	     2,496</p>
<p> Kemira Pigments	   1,363	    1,537	     2,161</p>
<p> Kemira Agro		 3,966	    3,852	     5,742</p>
<p> Tikkurila		   1,034		967	     1,352</p>
<p> Other 1)			698		798	     1,194</p>
<p> Intragroup sales	   -438	     -392		-593</p>
<p> TOTAL			 8,425	    8,419	    12,352</p>
<p>    Operating profit:  Jan-Aug 96     Jan-Aug 95	Jan-Dec 95</p>
<p> Kemira Chemicals	    278		255		 379</p>
<p> Kemira Pigments	     -13		211		 255</p>
<p> Kemira Agro		   539		443		 655</p>
<p> Tikkurila		     181		128		 144</p>
<p> Other 1)			-74		-66		 -96</p>
<p> TOTAL			   911		971	     1,337</p>
<p>1) Includes other operations, corporate administration and eliminations from operating profit.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom + 358 - 0 - 680 50 240</p>
</text>
